(7120615, 1087584, 136989, '<td valign="top">I hope you have outtakes for either the fall or oct challenges.  :)  This is an incredibly beautiful picture.  The pastels of the sky partnered with the earthy tones on land.  It''s gorgeous.  In a way the buildings look a bit like snow too.  Fantastic work.</td>', 'I hope you have outtakes for either the fall or oct challenges.  :)  This is an incredibly beautiful picture.  The pastels of the sky partnered with the earthy tones on land.  It''s gorgeous.  In a way the buildings look a bit like snow too.  Fantastic work.', '2013-10-22 23:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120619, 1087375, 136989, '<td valign="top">I just told my husband that "I want to go visit here" ... wherever "here" is.  This is gorgeous.  I can''t believe the smoothness of the water and such vibrant pre-dawn light.  Beautiful work.</td>', 'I just told my husband that "I want to go visit here" ... wherever "here" is.  This is gorgeous.  I can''t believe the smoothness of the water and such vibrant pre-dawn light.  Beautiful work.', '2013-10-22 23:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120620, 1087884, 136989, '<td valign="top">Great colors and a wonderful abstract.</td>', 'Great colors and a wonderful abstract.', '2013-10-22 23:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120622, 1087798, 136989, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  I feel as if I have actually just looked into the sun myself. Neat trick. :)</td>', 'Nicely done.  I feel as if I have actually just looked into the sun myself. Neat trick. :)', '2013-10-22 23:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120625, 1087897, 136989, '<td valign="top">I am so jealous.  The leaves don''t turn where I live and you have a forest of red leaves.  (I usually only seem to visit places with yellow and orange ones.) I love the touches of green and the balance of the sun glow with the red.</td>', 'I am so jealous.  The leaves don''t turn where I live and you have a forest of red leaves.  (I usually only seem to visit places with yellow and orange ones.) I love the touches of green and the balance of the sun glow with the red.', '2013-10-22 23:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120627, 1087538, 136989, '<td valign="top">This is a magical shot ...  I half expect a unicorn or fairy to step out from behind the tree.  Beautiful composition and I love how the highlights accent the sunlight.</td>', 'This is a magical shot ...  I half expect a unicorn or fairy to step out from behind the tree.  Beautiful composition and I love how the highlights accent the sunlight.', '2013-10-22 23:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7120630, 1087831, 136989, '<td valign="top">I have always been a sucker for pictures that depict a road or trail that leads off into the unknown.  It makes me want to grab my hiking shoes and start walking.  I love the detail in the grass and along the lane.  I also love how the mist combines with the sunlight to create a dream like feeling.  This is my favorite in this challenge.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1082013" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/136989/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1082013.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/136989/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1082013.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/136989/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1082013.jpg"/></a></td>', 'I have always been a sucker for pictures that depict a road or trail that leads off into the unknown.  It makes me want to grab my hiking shoes and start walking.  I love the detail in the grass and along the lane.  I also love how the mist combines with the sunlight to create a dream like feeling.  This is my favorite in this challenge.', '2013-10-22 23:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
