(7122284, 1087878, 147314, '<td valign="top">Too many sunflowers in this challenge, but this one is among the better ones. I like the composition and the processing.</td>', 'Too many sunflowers in this challenge, but this one is among the better ones. I like the composition and the processing.', '2013-10-27 17:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122286, 1087375, 170281, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous photograph.  I like how you used the line up of boats to lead the viewer to the sunrise.  The reflection on the water is beautiful dimension of this photo.  Everyone''s view of the event is different, subjective, but I like to see more deepness in the color, as well as range of color cast from the sun.  All in all, great photo!</td>', 'Gorgeous photograph.  I like how you used the line up of boats to lead the viewer to the sunrise.  The reflection on the water is beautiful dimension of this photo.  Everyone''s view of the event is different, subjective, but I like to see more deepness in the color, as well as range of color cast from the sun.  All in all, great photo!', '2013-10-27 17:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
