(7122290, 1087859, 170281, '<td valign="top">I like the way you have used the rule of thirds to bring the viewer''s focus on the surfer and structure at the end of pier.  Anyone who has spent time on the beach and in the water during this time of day can feel the peacefulness brought out in your photo.  Nice job!</td>', 'I like the way you have used the rule of thirds to bring the viewer''s focus on the surfer and structure at the end of pier.  Anyone who has spent time on the beach and in the water during this time of day can feel the peacefulness brought out in your photo.  Nice job!', '2013-10-27 17:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122291, 1087906, 147314, '<td valign="top">Nice view on this challenge, I like the details in this image. [commenting only]</td>', 'Nice view on this challenge, I like the details in this image. [commenting only]', '2013-10-27 17:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122292, 1087753, 170281, '<td valign="top">I really like the deep richness of color in this photo.  The colors and reflection are well done.</td>', 'I really like the deep richness of color in this photo.  The colors and reflection are well done.', '2013-10-27 18:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122294, 1087864, 170281, '<td valign="top">Very artistic photo.  The framing is terrific.</td>', 'Very artistic photo.  The framing is terrific.', '2013-10-27 18:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122295, 1087787, 170281, '<td valign="top">I get the composition of the photo.  I think it would be greatly enhanced with a bit more depth of field and deepness of color, especially the blue of the sky.  Good eye for an interesting shot.</td>', 'I get the composition of the photo.  I think it would be greatly enhanced with a bit more depth of field and deepness of color, especially the blue of the sky.  Good eye for an interesting shot.', '2013-10-27 18:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122296, 1087584, 170281, '<td valign="top">I really like the surreal feel of the photo.  The transition from the color forefront to the almost gray-scale background, gives me the impression of a view from a bright, welcoming environment to a dark and forbidden territory.  Nicely done!</td>', 'I really like the surreal feel of the photo.  The transition from the color forefront to the almost gray-scale background, gives me the impression of a view from a bright, welcoming environment to a dark and forbidden territory.  Nicely done!', '2013-10-27 18:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122297, 1087865, 170281, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo with good coloring and contrast.  It does not give me a "Wow" factor, but there is something that is very appealing.  Well done.</td>', 'Very nice photo with good coloring and contrast.  It does not give me a "Wow" factor, but there is something that is very appealing.  Well done.', '2013-10-27 18:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122298, 1087749, 170281, '<td valign="top">I love moon shots, especially since I have yet to learn to master them.  The framing against the side of the mountain is terrific.  Nicely done!</td>', 'I love moon shots, especially since I have yet to learn to master them.  The framing against the side of the mountain is terrific.  Nicely done!', '2013-10-27 18:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122299, 1087810, 28427, '<td valign="top">Amazing image - a real master piece. - Commenting only.</td>', 'Amazing image - a real master piece. - Commenting only.', '2013-10-27 18:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122300, 1087803, 28427, '<td valign="top">Mysterious sun, experimental - commenting only.</td>', 'Mysterious sun, experimental - commenting only.', '2013-10-27 18:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122301, 1087906, 28427, '<td valign="top">Clean, simple and straight forward.  Nicely sharp.  - commenting only.</td>', 'Clean, simple and straight forward.  Nicely sharp.  - commenting only.', '2013-10-27 18:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122302, 1087897, 170281, '<td valign="top">I really like the capture of colors and sunburst quality of the sun.  This is very subjective, but I find a greater depth of field would really enhance this photo.  Very nice work!</td>', 'I really like the capture of colors and sunburst quality of the sun.  This is very subjective, but I find a greater depth of field would really enhance this photo.  Very nice work!', '2013-10-27 18:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122304, 1087654, 28427, '<td valign="top">A beautiful piece of nature with a nice warm glow in the water. Lucky seals and lucky you having access to this.  Thank you for sharing this beautiful part of your world.<br/>- commenting only.</td>', 'A beautiful piece of nature with a nice warm glow in the water. Lucky seals and lucky you having access to this.  Thank you for sharing this beautiful part of your world.- commenting only.', '2013-10-27 18:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122305, 1087928, 170281, '<td valign="top">I am a true fan of the black and white.  Although it took the caption to help me understand it was an overgrown sundial, I like the light and dark contrasts.  One distraction for me, is the sundial arm which is a line that directs my attention to the upper left corner of the photo which I do not think is the central point you expected the viewer to set his/her focus.  Nice photo!</td>', 'I am a true fan of the black and white.  Although it took the caption to help me understand it was an overgrown sundial, I like the light and dark contrasts.  One distraction for me, is the sundial arm which is a line that directs my attention to the upper left corner of the photo which I do not think is the central point you expected the viewer to set his/her focus.  Nice photo!', '2013-10-27 18:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122306, 1087744, 170281, '<td valign="top">Very, very nice!  I love black and white.  Your capture of the sunburst and spots across the photo is a very attractive, artistic aspect of the photo.  The graininess gives a sense of an older time period, and the perspective is a great aspect of the framing.  Great work.</td>', 'Very, very nice!  I love black and white.  Your capture of the sunburst and spots across the photo is a very attractive, artistic aspect of the photo.  The graininess gives a sense of an older time period, and the perspective is a great aspect of the framing.  Great work.', '2013-10-27 18:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122307, 1087560, 170281, '<td valign="top">When I first looked at this photo, I said "Nice depth of color".  Clouds are clearly one of the most interesting aspects of good sunrise an sunset shots.  I will add, I would prefer to see some reference to the ground-sky line, even if just minor.  Good work!</td>', 'When I first looked at this photo, I said "Nice depth of color".  Clouds are clearly one of the most interesting aspects of good sunrise an sunset shots.  I will add, I would prefer to see some reference to the ground-sky line, even if just minor.  Good work!', '2013-10-27 18:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122308, 1087834, 170281, '<td valign="top">Very nice, artistic photo.  I like how the lines of the posts lead the viewer back to the horizon and sunrise.  I know the view of this day and event is in the eye of the beholder, but I think a bit more depth in the color of the sunrise would be a nice enhancement.  Beautiful photo!</td>', 'Very nice, artistic photo.  I like how the lines of the posts lead the viewer back to the horizon and sunrise.  I know the view of this day and event is in the eye of the beholder, but I think a bit more depth in the color of the sunrise would be a nice enhancement.  Beautiful photo!', '2013-10-27 18:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122309, 1087384, 61396, '<td valign="top">good sneaking behind his back.</td>', 'good sneaking behind his back.', '2013-10-27 18:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122310, 1087918, 170281, '<td valign="top">Great use of the dock and building lines to lead the viewer to the setting sky.  The clean features enhance the overall characteristics of this picture.  Capturing the edge lighting without detracting too much from the sky is well nicely done.</td>', 'Great use of the dock and building lines to lead the viewer to the setting sky.  The clean features enhance the overall characteristics of this picture.  Capturing the edge lighting without detracting too much from the sky is well nicely done.', '2013-10-27 18:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122311, 1087089, 170281, '<td valign="top">I can see the people relaxing in the chairs getting a view of the landscape and enjoying the sea air.  The antiqueness of the photo gives a sense of a time past.  The lines of the chairs and deck planks leads my eye to the sunlit peninsula and waterway.  Very nice work!</td>', 'I can see the people relaxing in the chairs getting a view of the landscape and enjoying the sea air.  The antiqueness of the photo gives a sense of a time past.  The lines of the chairs and deck planks leads my eye to the sunlit peninsula and waterway.  Very nice work!', '2013-10-27 18:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122313, 1087384, 170281, '<td valign="top">I really like back and white, and I think I understand the context of the photo.  However, the general subject matter, including man entering the car, is somewhat distracting.  I am not sure the depth of editing you applied, but the main features that jump out are over-exposure and additional softness.</td>', 'I really like back and white, and I think I understand the context of the photo.  However, the general subject matter, including man entering the car, is somewhat distracting.  I am not sure the depth of editing you applied, but the main features that jump out are over-exposure and additional softness.', '2013-10-27 19:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122314, 1087639, 170281, '<td valign="top">Very nice framing and color depth, even in the softer background.  The artistic quality is top-notch.  Nice photo!</td>', 'Very nice framing and color depth, even in the softer background.  The artistic quality is top-notch.  Nice photo!', '2013-10-27 19:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122315, 1087704, 170281, '<td valign="top">Very nice work on the richness of the colors and the framing of the tree in the upper left.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Very nice work on the richness of the colors and the framing of the tree in the upper left.  Nicely done!', '2013-10-27 19:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122316, 1087538, 114225, '<td valign="top">The moss on that tree is exquisite.</td>', 'The moss on that tree is exquisite.', '2013-10-27 19:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122317, 1086950, 170281, '<td valign="top">There is something intriguing about this photo that keeps me viewing it.  I cannot tell if it is the sci-fi aspects of the image or my continuous attempt to define what the facility is all about.  Very creative!</td>', 'There is something intriguing about this photo that keeps me viewing it.  I cannot tell if it is the sci-fi aspects of the image or my continuous attempt to define what the facility is all about.  Very creative!', '2013-10-27 19:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
