(7122320, 1087831, 114225, '<td valign="top">Fantastic. I really enjoy shots like this.<br/> <br/>A tip, that has helped me with this type of HDR recently. Manually dodge the sky to bring it back to life. It''s ok if some of the sun rays blow out, that is how the eye sees it too.</td>', 'Fantastic. I really enjoy shots like this. A tip, that has helped me with this type of HDR recently. Manually dodge the sky to bring it back to life. It''s ok if some of the sun rays blow out, that is how the eye sees it too.', '2013-10-27 19:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122321, 1087827, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the muted color here.</td>', 'I like the muted color here.', '2013-10-27 19:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
