(7122331, 1087696, 170281, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Not enough folks understand the pureness achieved by black and white, even for capturing scenes that are noted for their color.  The framing is great, and the simplicity of the content is perfect.  Very nice photo!</td>', 'Very nice.  Not enough folks understand the pureness achieved by black and white, even for capturing scenes that are noted for their color.  The framing is great, and the simplicity of the content is perfect.  Very nice photo!', '2013-10-27 19:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
