(7122338, 1087760, 170281, '<td valign="top">Great color and crispness in the photo.  There is a lot going on in the photo with the sun, crescent shadow, and minuet.  Nice photo!</td>', 'Great color and crispness in the photo.  There is a lot going on in the photo with the sun, crescent shadow, and minuet.  Nice photo!', '2013-10-27 19:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122341, 1087866, 170281, '<td valign="top">Exquisite color and great framing.  Your use of the spit of land to point toward the sunset, and the position of the people, especially the young girl, is outstanding.  Great work!</td>', 'Exquisite color and great framing.  Your use of the spit of land to point toward the sunset, and the position of the people, especially the young girl, is outstanding.  Great work!', '2013-10-27 19:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122342, 1087099, 170281, '<td valign="top">Very nice framing.  I am partial to black and white and the contrasts it brings to the photo.  Very nice!</td>', 'Very nice framing.  I am partial to black and white and the contrasts it brings to the photo.  Very nice!', '2013-10-27 19:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122343, 1087922, 170281, '<td valign="top">I understand the content, and I like the use of the road lines to lead the viewer to the Sunsphere, but bus stop sign and minor road work are distractions.  I think there is good subject matter, but the photo looks a bit like an unplanned shot.</td>', 'I understand the content, and I like the use of the road lines to lead the viewer to the Sunsphere, but bus stop sign and minor road work are distractions.  I think there is good subject matter, but the photo looks a bit like an unplanned shot.', '2013-10-27 19:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122345, 1087513, 170281, '<td valign="top">I like the way the lines of the large branch on the right lead to and cradle the sunburst.  I am not sure if more depth of field could have captured the interesting characteristics of the bark, but I think it would have added to the primary content matter.  Nice work!</td>', 'I like the way the lines of the large branch on the right lead to and cradle the sunburst.  I am not sure if more depth of field could have captured the interesting characteristics of the bark, but I think it would have added to the primary content matter.  Nice work!', '2013-10-27 19:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7122346, 1087077, 170281, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture of vertical and horizontal lines.  I really like the simplicity of the content which enhances its artistic quality.  Good work!</td>', 'Very nice capture of vertical and horizontal lines.  I really like the simplicity of the content which enhances its artistic quality.  Good work!', '2013-10-27 19:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
