(7123307, 1087942, 124982, '<td valign="top">Good finish, Scott!! Really like the starburst and lens flare!</td>', 'Good finish, Scott!! Really like the starburst and lens flare!', '2013-10-29 20:37:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(7123321, 1087739, 43463, '<td valign="top">Great pose and action that recalls the days of yesteryear where paperboys would shout out for a newspaper sale on street corners. I can hear "Read all about it!" as I gaze at the picture. Lighting is spot on and the processing brings out the great textures all throughout. Congrats on the 4th place!</td>', 'Great pose and action that recalls the days of yesteryear where paperboys would shout out for a newspaper sale on street corners. I can hear "Read all about it!" as I gaze at the picture. Lighting is spot on and the processing brings out the great textures all throughout. Congrats on the 4th place!', '2013-10-29 21:44:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(7123325, 1087555, 43463, '<td valign="top">Fabulous lighting here! Love the volleyball action - especially of the airborne player ready to spike the ball over the net. Great silhouettes! And a truly nice little bene is the shadow on the sand of that airborne player - his arms look like wings...now I have the song "I want to fly like an eagle to the sea" going through my head. Congrats on the top 10 finish!</td>', 'Fabulous lighting here! Love the volleyball action - especially of the airborne player ready to spike the ball over the net. Great silhouettes! And a truly nice little bene is the shadow on the sand of that airborne player - his arms look like wings...now I have the song "I want to fly like an eagle to the sea" going through my head. Congrats on the top 10 finish!', '2013-10-29 21:53:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(7123461, 1087776, 20799, '<td valign="top">Great image, Garry, and a well deserved TPL win :). Still hugely underrated.</td>', 'Great image, Garry, and a well deserved TPL win :). Still hugely underrated.', '2013-10-30 04:18:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(7123499, 1087776, 108069, '<td valign="top">Not sure why you had low hopes for this or why it didn''t do much better. It''s really well done, and with a few basic ingredients you''ve got a great high-key and richly muted color shot here. Processing is excellent. I''d certainly be happy to be able to do this, but I don''t think I could. Maybe because I lack the light, living in a cave as I do.<br/> <br/>Either way, it''s a major departure from your B&amp;Ws, and it''s good to mix it up to stay fresh.</td>', 'Not sure why you had low hopes for this or why it didn''t do much better. It''s really well done, and with a few basic ingredients you''ve got a great high-key and richly muted color shot here. Processing is excellent. I''d certainly be happy to be able to do this, but I don''t think I could. Maybe because I lack the light, living in a cave as I do. Either way, it''s a major departure from your B&Ws, and it''s good to mix it up to stay fresh.', '2013-10-30 07:52:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(7123531, 1087859, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great colors, and crisp and clear. Great shot, dude.</td>', 'Great colors, and crisp and clear. Great shot, dude.', '2013-10-30 09:38:26.000000', NULL, 0),
